cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this work, please cite it as below. Private pre-publication repository (2026-09-25)."
title: "UCM — A Compact Relational Controller for Structured Execution"
abstract: >-
  Technical report on the Universal Control Model (UCM): a ~0.7 M-parameter
  relational policy for fast, cheap structured execution with calibrated
  abstention, evaluated in two exactly solvable worlds (TinyGraphKey and SIW)
  under a pre-registered, sealed, single-read evaluation discipline.
authors:
